                                                "sense_id": "f50e3cc0-e563-3d6b-9fb8-6c74597097a4",
                                                "text": "What guards the purity of melting maids, / In courtly balls, and midnight masquerades [...]?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce21b742-165b-3a5a-975e-46f346a912e3",
                                        "entry_id": "030416fd-d78d-34a5-8d24-f24145afa1f7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "That causes one to melt with emotion; able to make others feel tender and emotional."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4b9b211a-f5ec-4d67-b141-63fb4241b96a",
                                                "sense_id": "ce21b742-165b-3a5a-975e-46f346a912e3",
                                                "text": "And he, Allada Khan, had decided that the child was not unlike himself - an unaggressive nose, and intelligent forehead, eyes both lively and melting."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
